does="A pre-flight checklist replaces the remembering. Built once per deliverable type, from launches to proposals to offsites, it captures every detail that has ever mattered, and every new miss gets added so the same mistake cannot happen twice. Running the list takes minutes and requires no detail instinct at all.",
device_title="The starter library",
